BT /F2 10 Tf 0.050 0.310 0.550 rg 58.0 639.0 Td (In brief) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 0.130 0.170 0.220 rg 58.0 624.0 Td (Microsoft Foundry is a platform for building AI applications with models and agents. It) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 0.130 0.170 0.220 rg 58.0 612.0 Td (brings development and management capabilities together, including model discovery, agent) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 0.130 0.170 0.220 rg 58.0 600.0 Td (tools, evaluation, and observability. Exact capabilities depend on the service, region,) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 0.130 0.170 0.220 rg 58.0 588.0 Td (and feature status.) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 0.050 0.310 0.550 rg 58.0 558.0 Td (What Foundry brings together) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 0.130 0.170 0.220 rg 58.0 539.0 Td (- Models: discover and compare models for a task, then deploy a model endpoint when your) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 0.130 0.170 0.220 rg 58.0 526.0 Td (  application needs one. The catalog spans Microsoft and partner offerings; availability and) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 0.130 0.170 0.220 rg 58.0 513.0 Td (  terms vary by model. [1][2]) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 0.130 0.170 0.220 rg 58.0 495.0 Td (- Agents: combine a model with instructions and tools so an application can respond to) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 0.130 0.170 0.220 rg 58.0 482.0 Td (  requests and take actions. Foundry Agent Service supports managed prompt agents and hosted) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 0.130 0.170 0.220 rg 58.0 469.0 Td (  agents, among other ways to build. [1][3]) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 0.130 0.170 0.220 rg 58.0 451.0 Td (- Projects: organize work in a Foundry project, where people can build, configure, and) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 0.130 0.170 0.220 rg 58.0 438.0 Td (  manage AI resources with shared project context. [1]) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 0.130 0.170 0.220 rg 58.0 420.0 Td (- Operations: use evaluation and observability capabilities to assess quality and inspect) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 0.130 0.170 0.220 rg 58.0 407.0 Td (  behavior across development and production workflows. [1][4]) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 0.050 0.310 0.550 rg 58.0 383.0 Td (A useful mental model) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 0.130 0.170 0.220 rg 58.0 364.0 Td (A model generates or interprets content. An agent adds instructions, context, and tools) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 0.130 0.170 0.220 rg 58.0 351.0 Td (  around a model. A project provides a place to configure and manage that work. Evaluation and) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 0.130 0.170 0.220 rg 58.0 338.0 Td (  observability help teams understand whether the solution behaves as intended.) Tj ET
0.910 0.950 0.980 rg 51 257 510 65 re f
