BT /F1 11 Tf 0.350 0.400 0.460 rg 58.0 680.0 Td (A practical sequence for shaping an AI application) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 0.050 0.310 0.550 rg 58.0 647.0 Td (1. Start with the task) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 0.130 0.170 0.220 rg 58.0 628.0 Td (Describe the user need, inputs, expected output, and risks. Decide whether a direct model) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 0.130 0.170 0.220 rg 58.0 615.0 Td (  call is sufficient or whether the application needs multi-step reasoning, persistent tools,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 0.130 0.170 0.220 rg 58.0 602.0 Td (  or managed agent behavior.) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 0.050 0.310 0.550 rg 58.0 578.0 Td (2. Select and test a model) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 0.130 0.170 0.220 rg 58.0 559.0 Td (Use the Foundry Models catalog to explore models and compare their documented capabilities.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 0.130 0.170 0.220 rg 58.0 546.0 Td (  Test candidates with representative prompts and data. Consider response quality, latency,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 0.130 0.170 0.220 rg 58.0 533.0 Td (  cost, safety requirements, and deployment availability; a catalog listing alone does not) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 0.130 0.170 0.220 rg 58.0 520.0 Td (  establish fit for your workload. [2]) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 0.050 0.310 0.550 rg 58.0 496.0 Td (3. Choose how to build the agent) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 0.130 0.170 0.220 rg 58.0 477.0 Td (- Prompt agent: define instructions, select a model, and connect tools while Foundry manages) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 0.130 0.170 0.220 rg 58.0 464.0 Td (  the agent runtime.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 0.130 0.170 0.220 rg 58.0 446.0 Td (- Hosted agent: package application code when you need greater control over frameworks or) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 0.130 0.170 0.220 rg 58.0 433.0 Td (  runtime behavior.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 0.130 0.170 0.220 rg 58.0 415.0 Td (- Responses API: call the API from an application you operate elsewhere when that) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 0.130 0.170 0.220 rg 58.0 402.0 Td (  architecture is a better fit. [3]) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 0.050 0.310 0.550 rg 58.0 378.0 Td (4. Add only the tools you need) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 0.130 0.170 0.220 rg 58.0 359.0 Td (Tools extend what an agent can do. Depending on the workflow, tools can include file search,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 0.130 0.170 0.220 rg 58.0 346.0 Td (  web search, code execution, MCP-connected tools, or custom functions. Give each tool a clear) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 0.130 0.170 0.220 rg 58.0 333.0 Td (  purpose and define the data and actions it is allowed to use. [3]) Tj ET
0.910 0.950 0.980 rg 51 264 510 53 re f
