BT /F2 21 Tf 0.050 0.310 0.550 rg 58.0 714.0 Td (Tools and trusted knowledge) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 0.350 0.400 0.460 rg 58.0 680.0 Td (How an agent can use information beyond its prompt) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 0.050 0.310 0.550 rg 58.0 647.0 Td (Tools connect an agent to capabilities) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 0.130 0.170 0.220 rg 58.0 628.0 Td (A tool gives an agent a defined way to retrieve information or request an action. Foundry) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 0.130 0.170 0.220 rg 58.0 615.0 Td (  Agent Service documents built-in options such as file search, web search, and code) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 0.130 0.170 0.220 rg 58.0 602.0 Td (  interpreter, along with MCP servers and custom functions. Tool availability and setup vary) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 0.130 0.170 0.220 rg 58.0 589.0 Td (  by agent type and configuration. [3]) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 0.050 0.310 0.550 rg 58.0 565.0 Td (Retrieval-augmented generation \(RAG\)) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 0.130 0.170 0.220 rg 58.0 546.0 Td (RAG combines retrieval with generation. An application searches a connected knowledge source) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 0.130 0.170 0.220 rg 58.0 533.0 Td (  for relevant passages, then supplies retrieved context to a model to help answer a question.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 0.130 0.170 0.220 rg 58.0 520.0 Td (  In a file-search workflow, source documents inform the answer; the model still generates the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 0.130 0.170 0.220 rg 58.0 507.0 Td (  response.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 0.130 0.170 0.220 rg 58.0 489.0 Td (- Prepare relevant, current documents and confirm that users are allowed to access them.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 0.130 0.170 0.220 rg 58.0 471.0 Td (- Ask questions that have answers in the source, then verify the response against the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 0.130 0.170 0.220 rg 58.0 458.0 Td (  retrieved material.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 0.130 0.170 0.220 rg 58.0 440.0 Td (- When evidence is missing or ambiguous, the application should say so rather than) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 0.130 0.170 0.220 rg 58.0 427.0 Td (  presenting a guess as a fact.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 0.130 0.170 0.220 rg 58.0 409.0 Td (- Treat retrieval as grounding assistance, not a guarantee of correctness. Test retrieval) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 0.130 0.170 0.220 rg 58.0 396.0 Td (  and answer quality with realistic questions.) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 0.050 0.310 0.550 rg 58.0 372.0 Td (A safe way to think about answers) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 0.130 0.170 0.220 rg 58.0 353.0 Td (A response can be fluent and still be unsupported. Check whether its claims match the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 0.130 0.170 0.220 rg 58.0 340.0 Td (  source, whether important context was omitted, and whether the answer clearly distinguishes) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 0.130 0.170 0.220 rg 58.0 327.0 Td (  documented facts from uncertainty.) Tj ET
0.910 0.950 0.980 rg 51 246 510 65 re f
BT /F2 10 Tf 0.050 0.310 0.550 rg 58.0 295.0 Td (Try it) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 0.130 0.170 0.220 rg 58.0 280.0 Td (Ask a file-search agent a factual question that the connected document answers, then ask a) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 0.130 0.170 0.220 rg 58.0 268.0 Td (question that the document does not cover. Compare the answer with the source and check) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 0.130 0.170 0.220 rg 58.0 256.0 Td (whether uncertainty is handled clearly.) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 0.050 0.310 0.550 rg 58.0 226.0 Td (Access and tool boundaries) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 0.130 0.170 0.220 rg 58.0 207.0 Td (Use the least access needed for the task. Review identity, permissions, network exposure,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 0.130 0.170 0.220 rg 58.0 194.0 Td (  and tool side effects. Do not connect sensitive data or allow consequential actions without) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 0.130 0.170 0.220 rg 58.0 181.0 Td (  appropriate authorization, testing, and human oversight.) Tj ET
