BT /F2 13 Tf 0.050 0.310 0.550 rg 58.0 516.0 Td (What to measure) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 0.130 0.170 0.220 rg 58.0 497.0 Td (Choose measures that reflect your use case. Examples include whether an answer is grounded) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 0.130 0.170 0.220 rg 58.0 484.0 Td (  in evidence, whether it addresses the request, whether it follows safety rules, and whether) Tj ET
