BT /F1 10 Tf 0.130 0.170 0.220 rg 58.0 402.0 Td (  surface quality or operational concerns. Use available telemetry responsibly: protect) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 0.130 0.170 0.220 rg 58.0 389.0 Td (  sensitive data, limit access, and align retention with organizational requirements. [4]) Tj ET
